<p>Working long hours at a forge has made you incredibly slow to tire and given you endless vitality.</p><p>Your healing factor is increased by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4%, 8%, 11%, 14%, 17%</acronym> and your life regeneration by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3.00, 4.51, 5.67, 6.64, 7.50.</acronym></p><p>Stopping you is nearly impossible; your pinning resistance is increased by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">17%, 28%, 35%, 41%, 46%.</acronym></p>